# Design Principles

UI/UX standards for this project. Agents should read this before visual or copy changes.

## Product feel

<!-- 2–4 words or a short sentence: calm, bold, dense, playful, … -->

## Anti-patterns (do not)

- Do not default to generic AI palettes (purple-on-white, purple→indigo glow)
- Do not wrap everything in cards
- Do not use Inter / Roboto / Arial / system UI as the expressive display face when brand type exists
- Do not put detached badges or promo chips on hero media

## C.L.E.A.R. checks

| Principle | Check |
|-----------|-------|
| **Copy** | Clear, concise, action-oriented |
| **Layout** | Logical flow; key actions visible |
| **Emphasis** | One main action per section |
| **Accessibility** | Keyboard, contrast, usable targets |
| **Reward** | Feedback on every important action |

